# Production build (npm run build, and the Vercel deployment). Public addresses, not secrets; Vite bundles them into the browser build.
# The API is reached through this site (`vercel.json` forwards /api/* to the server), so the sign-in cookie is first-party and works in Safari and on iPhone.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
# Vercel cannot forward a WebSocket, so the live chat connects to the server directly.
VITE_HUB_URL=https://princessvoyages.runasp.net/api/v1
